# The char graph is materialized at dev-link / publish time from $MAILWOMAN_DATA_ROOT/models/v8-cjk-*/served-package/
# (per the `files` array in package.json); it is not committed. The sealed character vocabulary IS committed: it is
# 29 KB, it is the model's whole tokenizer, and a graph without the exact vocabulary it was trained under encodes
# every character wrong.
/model.onnx
